# copy the cutover replaced.
MODULE: SupersededCopyTakesNoWriteRedirectIgnored
TARGET: SupersededCopyTakesNoWrite
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a stale router's write ignores the armed redirect
PERTURBS: StaleWrite

